  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'how i see', which is positioned below the podium. This projection is implied by the phrase 'how i see', where 'i' directly refers to the user or the meme creator, indicating that the user is identifying with or adopting this personal, subjective perspective. The user is thus projected onto this text, which represents their own viewpoint in contrast to the official perspective ('how they see') represented by the man at the podium.",
